  "description": "Faerie — a fluent, UI-agnostic C# engine for building text adventures / interactive fiction (the \"Fluent Adventure Engine\"). Rooms, things, creatures and verbs wired by reference (no magic strings); a flexible parser; reactions and daemons; output filters; and JSON save/load. The engine renders through an abstract ITerminal; terminal front ends ship separately (Faerie.Terminal, Faerie.Terminal.Avalonia). Ships no fonts of its own.",
